  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Dokuzlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nBu kart\u0131n sana hay\u0131rl\u0131 haberleri var {{isim}}. Bir
    defa, \u015Fanss\u0131z oldu\u011Funu art\u0131k asla d\xFC\u015F\xFCnme. Kart\u0131n\u0131n
    ters a\xE7\u0131lmas\u0131 bile senin i\xE7in b\xFCy\xFCk bir \u015Fans. Arad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Fa yava\u015F yava\u015F yakla\u015F\u0131yorsun. Seni
    her bak\u0131mdan bunaltan o esaretin art\u0131k son buluyor. Can\u0131n\u0131
    kimsenin s\u0131kamayaca\u011F\u0131 g\xFCnlere do\u011Fru ilerliyorsun. Zor
    zamanlara herkes gibi belli bir d\xF6nem maruz kalm\u0131\u015F ve art\u0131k
    s\u0131ran\u0131 savm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. I\u015F\u0131\u011Fa ne kadar yakla\u015Fm\u0131\u015F
    oldu\u011Funu sen de fark edecek durumdas\u0131n. Art\u0131k tamiri m\xFCmk\xFCn
    de\u011Fil sand\u0131\u011F\u0131n yaralar\u0131n iyile\u015Fiyor. Korkular\u0131n\u0131n
    yerini ferah bir g\xFCn ve s\u0131cac\u0131k bir g\xFCne\u015F al\u0131yor. Bak,
    iyi ki baz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n s\xF6z\xFCn\xFC dinliyorsun..."
